# Experiment mocks stay out of the game

Horse, K9, ape/monkey, duck-recolor, and other species studies are **mocks only**. Do not use them in the running game.

Live mascot and judges stay the ducks:

- Hub / map / rank-up: `assets/duck-hub-mascot.png`, `assets/duck-hub-mascot-jacket.png`, `assets/duck-hub-mascot-ace.png`
- Mixologist judges: `data.js` `JUDGES` + `assets/judges/{id}.png` (duck roster)

Keep experiments under `mocks/` only, including:

- `mocks/mascot-alts/`
- `mocks/horse-judges/`
- `mocks/duck-recolor/`

Do not copy those files into `assets/`, `assets/judges/`, `resources/`, or `mobile/assets/`. Do not add horse/K9/primate IDs to `JUDGES`, `CUSTOMER_BASES`, or CSS `url()` for hub/map/splash. Do not flip a pilot flag that swaps the live duck roster.
